# Decay manager. The base engine kept every decaying item in four lists and walked one of them every 250 ms,
# subtracting the elapsed time from each item's duration (so a field, corpse or ring cost CPU every second, and the
# remaining time was only accurate to a few hundred ms). Decaying items now sit in a map keyed by the time they decay
# (src/decay.cpp, the idea and copyright header are TFS's own later "decay" class); one scheduler event waits for the
# earliest entry and nothing runs while nothing is due.
#   * a decaying item carries ITEM_ATTRIBUTE_DURATION_TIMESTAMP (runtime only, never saved); Item::getDuration() returns
#     the time left from it, so descriptions ("will expire in ..."), item:getAttribute(ITEM_ATTRIBUTE_DURATION), the
#     saves of players and houses and the client duration all see the exact remaining time; stopping a decay writes the
#     remaining time back to ITEM_ATTRIBUTE_DURATION (rings taken off with stopduration, items leaving the world,
#     players logging out), so durations are kept across logout and server restart exactly as before.
#   * unchanged rules: decayTo chains, canDecay(), startDecay()/item:decay(), items in containers (Container::
#     startDecaying), transformDeEquipTo / transformEquipTo, setID() restarting the duration of a transformed item,
#     clones continuing from the original's remaining time, items without a world (removed with a logged-out player)
#     stop decaying and keep their remaining time (a 10 s sweep covers items whose parent chain was removed).
#   * Game::stopDecay is called wherever an item leaves the game (internalRemoveItem, merges, transforms) so the map
#     never holds an item that was freed.
#   * item:setAttribute / removeAttribute of ITEM_ATTRIBUTE_DURATION on a decaying item restart the countdown with the
#     new value; the timestamp attribute itself is not readable or writable from Lua.
# Adds src/decay.cpp and src/decay.h (listed in src/CMakeLists.txt; a Visual Studio project needs the two files added by hand).
# Apply in the server source root after 0001-0005: patch -p1 < 0006-decay-manager.patch, then rebuild everything
# (game.h and item.h change).
